    "plan_update_summary": "### Cycle #21 Post-Mortem & Parameter Mutation\nOut-of-sample testing with DeepSeek V4.1 Flash achieved net profitability (PF: 1.08, Win Rate: 50.0%), outperforming the zero-AI baseline (PF: 0.81), though net returns were heavily compressed by transaction fee drag (\u20b937.14 fees vs \u20b95.90 net P&L). Forensics on the losing cluster revealed two primary failure modes: mid-day/afternoon entries (11:25\u201314:10) stalling into EOD square-offs short of the 1.45% target, and 10:25 AM post-open reversals clipping the 0.65% stop loss. To mitigate EOD stagnation and overcome fee drag, we are compressing `min_target_pct` to 1.25% to capture realistic intraday swings and pulling `breakeven_trigger_r` down to 0.85R to protect capital earlier. Simultaneously, we are raising `min_sweep_vol_multiplier` to 2.65x to filter out low-conviction mid-day liquidity sweeps and widening `min_sl_pct` to 0.70% to provide structural breathing room against morning noise."
